Package: jocky
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NTRO JOCKY Team <vmmuthu20000@gmail.com>
Description: JOCKY Enterprise Digital Forensics Platform
 JOCKY is a forensic DSL compiler and command-and-control platform
 for authorized computer and network forensic analysis under the
 IT Act 2000 Section 69. It compiles .jocky scripts to polymorphic
 LLVM IR and supports Windows/Linux field agents.
Homepage: https://github.com/vmmuthu31/jocky
